    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to care about \"small ways\" when the whole scale is so massive and indifferent. if it's all just a blip, then why even bother with the struggle? the \"choosing\" part feels like just another chore. it's like we're all just pretending there's a reason to keep the engine running.",
