      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right—it can feel like a cruel joke, like we're all just spinning wheels on a car going nowhere. But here's the thing: if nothing matters in the grand scheme, then the struggle only has the weight you give it. You don't have to pretend there's a grand reason; you can just exist, and that's allowed. The engine doesn't have to run for a destination—it can just hum for the sake of the sound.",
